8) Notification & Alert flow suggestions

Critical alerts: Use CloudWatch Alarm -> SNS -> PagerDuty/Slack/email. CloudWatch alarms are reliable and integrated with AWS.

Grafana: Best for visualization and secondary alerting or for teams that centralize alerting in Grafana. If you use Grafana for alerts, ensure Grafana server is highly available and alerting notification channels are configured.

Silencing & dedup: If multiple processes fail from the same cause (system down), create a higher-level alarm or use runbook automation.

