11) Additional improvements & considerations

Use pid files or systemd service names for more deterministic checks (systemctl is-active myservice) if your processes are managed via systemd.

Add metrics for process restarts/exit codes if you want richer observability.

Add retries & exponential backoff if PutMetricData fails temporarily.

Rate-limits: CloudWatch supports high cardinality but keep number of unique metric-dimension combos reasonable. Five processes is fine.

Security: Use instance profile role (no long-term credentials). Restrict IAM policy further to only required resources if possible.

Logging: Rotate /var/log/process-monitor.log using logrotate.


